specification:
  - Pedigree
  - |
    An enumerated value from set `https://gedcom.io/terms/v7/enumset-PEDI`
    indicating the type of child-to-family relationship represented by the
    superstructure.
    
    A `DATE` substructure gives when that type of relationship applied, such as the
    period a child was fostered in the family.
    
    <div class="example">
    
    The following indicates that a child was fostered in one family from 1921 to
    1923 and in another from 1924 to 1926.
    
    ```gedcom
    0 @I1@ INDI
    1 FAMC @F1@
    2 PEDI FOSTER
    3 DATE FROM 1921 TO 1923
    1 FAMC @F2@
    2 PEDI FOSTER
    3 DATE FROM 1924 TO 1926
    ```
    
    </div>

label: 'Pedigree'

